Package: csvgrid
Title: Interactive, Type-Aware Tables from Data Frames (the 'csv-viewer' Grid)
Version: 3.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Stephen J.", "Mildenhall", , "stephen.j.mildenhall@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Render a data frame or tibble as an interactive 'CsvGrid'
    table, the embeddable grid from the 'csv-viewer' project. Columns are
    typed automatically (number, date, text) with opinionated formatting:
    numbers right-aligned with thousands separators and uniform decimals,
    ratio and rate columns as percentages, identifier-like columns without
    separators, dates as ISO and centered, text left-aligned, and
    equal-risk column-width allocation. Includes fuzzy global search,
    per-column filters, and sortable headers. A drop-in alternative to
    'DT::datatable()' for the common case. Works in the 'RStudio' Viewer,
    'R Markdown', 'Quarto', and 'shiny' via 'htmlwidgets'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    htmlwidgets
Suggests:
    DT
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
